  "id": "self-handicapping",
  "term": "self-handicapping",
  "definition": "Self-handicapping is a defensive strategy in which a person reduces effort or creates obstacles for themselves when a challenging task feels threatening to their competence. It serves to protect self-image by providing a way to explain poor performance.",
